{
  "$comment": "首批天文信源：首次启动时导入（scripts/seed.ts），已存在的不会被覆盖。web_list 源用 url 作列表页入口（baseUrl 仅作相对链接基准）；中文选择器部署阶段抓真实页面后填 itemSelector/linkSelector/titleSelector，正式上线前在后台“预览抓取”人工复核。科学刊物候选源（rss-journal-*）一律 enabled:false，是否启用由主审单独批准；它们只走已有的 RSS 通路与摘要导读分支，不复制全文、不转载图片。候选 feed 配置一律保留在此，是否接入由启用开关控制；本项目不预先判定任何来源的使用许可。",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "web-bao-research",
      "name": "国家天文台 · 科研动态",
      "kind": "web_list",
      "config": {
        "url": "https://www.bao.ac.cn/news/ky/",
        "allowUrlRegex": "^https://www\\.bao\\.ac\\.cn/news/ky/[0-9]{6}/t[0-9]{8}_[0-9]+\\.html(?:[?#].*)?$",
        "_aihot": {
          "initialBackfillLimit": 5
        },
        "allowUrlPrefixes": [
          "https://www.bao.ac.cn/news/ky/20"
        ],
        "linkSelector": "a[href]",
        "publishedAtUtcOffset": "+08:00",
        "itemSelector": "li:has(.box-date)",
        "publishedAtSelector": ".box-date"
      },
      "tier": "T1",
      "owner_entity_id": "bao",
      "participation_mode": "editorial",
      "interval_minutes": 240,
      "tags": [
        "官方",
        "科研成果"
      ],
      "site_fulltext": false,
      "syndicate_fulltext": false
    },
